  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="price_clause">
        <p>Ego Pannocchieschus filius Ugolini de Pannocchieschis locabo et concedo tibi priori Iohanni hospitalis Sanctae Mariae de la Scala vineas meas positas in territorio Senensi, in loco qui dicitur Chianti, cum omnibus palis, fossis et instrumentis vinariis, pro annuo censu quartarum viginti musti boni et puri, solvendo in vindemia cuiuslibet anni.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="penalty_clause">
        <p>Si quis contra hanc locationem venire temptaverit, componat auri optimi libras septem, et haec carta firma permaneat in perpetuum.</p>
      </div>
      <listWitness>
        <witness><name>Salimbenus filius Rainerii</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Tolomeus filius Iacobi</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Forteguerra filius Cacciaguidae</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Saracenus de Saracinis</name></witness>
      </listWitness>
    </body>
